commit a1b192cb51f50e0c6fa76eea8008433c1ce01c09
Author: Sam Builder <sam@example.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 16 15:34:15 2026 +0200

    feat(runner): Token saver filter engine — filter, filter-hook, raw store, stats (#445)

    The runner's own command-output filter (spec 445 D2-D4, amendments 3, 5, 6):

    - `agentdock-runner filter -- <argv>` runs the command, keeps the raw output
      in `<run dir>/raw/<n>.log` (10 MB cap with a marker), and prints a
      compressed version when a family filter covers the command.
    - `agentdock-runner filter-hook` is the PreToolUse hook: it rewrites only a
      single simple command a filter covers, and it fails open.
    - Stats: one JSONL row per command in $AGENTDOCK_FILTER_STATS.

    Closes #445 (part of)
    Reviewed-by: Dana Reviewer <dana@example.com>

